                   "PrimaryDefinition":  "\u003col\u003e\u003cli data-details=\"Jitendex.org [2025-02-11]\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag-list\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag dict-group__tag--name\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag-inner\"\u003epriority form\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag dict-group__tag--name\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag-inner\"\u003e★\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag dict-group__tag--dict\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag-inner\"\u003eJitendex.org [2025-02-11]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__glossary\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cul lang=\"ja\" style=\"list-style-type: \u0026quot;＊\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"v1\" title=\"Ichidan verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003e1-dan\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"vt\" title=\"transitive verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003etransitive\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan title=\"valid only for these forms and/or readings\" style=\"cursor: help;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: crimson;\"\u003e〔\u003c/span\u003eよける only\u003cspan style=\"color: crimson;\"\u003e〕\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;①\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\" style=\"padding-left: 0px; list-style-type: none;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto avoid (physical contact with)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"extra-info\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence\" data-sc-source=\"213005\" style=\"background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)) 5%, transparent); border-color: var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)); border-style: none none none solid; border-radius: 0.4rem; border-width: calc(3em / var(--font-size-no-units, 14)); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem;\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-a\" style=\"font-size: 1.3em;\"\u003eそのスピードを\u003cruby\u003e出\u003crt\u003eだ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eした\u003cruby\u003e車\u003crt\u003eくるま\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eは\u003cruby\u003e道\u003crt\u003eどう\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003e\u003cruby\u003e路\u003crt\u003eろ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eに\u003cruby\u003e飛\u003crt\u003eと\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eび\u003cruby\u003e出\u003crt\u003eだ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eした\u003cruby\u003e子\u003crt\u003eこ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003e\u003cruby\u003e供\u003crt\u003eども\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eを、\u003cruby\u003e間\u003crt\u003eかん\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003e\u003cruby\u003e一\u003crt\u003eいっ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003e\u003cruby\u003e髪\u003crt\u003eぱつ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eで、\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"example-keyword\" style=\"color: color-mix(in srgb, lime, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)));\"\u003e\u003cruby\u003e避\u003crt\u003eさ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eける\u003c/span\u003eことができた。\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-b\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\"\u003eThe speeding car missed the child, who ran out into the road, by only a hairsbreadth.\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"attribution-footnote\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: rgb(119, 119, 119); vertical-align: top; margin-left: 0.25rem;\"\u003e[1]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin-top: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"v1\" title=\"Ichidan verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003e1-dan\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"vt\" title=\"transitive verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003etransitive\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan title=\"valid only for these forms and/or readings\" style=\"cursor: help;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: crimson;\"\u003e〔\u003c/span\u003eさける only\u003cspan style=\"color: crimson;\"\u003e〕\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;②\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto avoid (situation)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto evade (question, subject)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto shirk (one\u0027s responsibilities)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"extra-info\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence\" data-sc-source=\"232798\" style=\"background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)) 5%, transparent); border-color: var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)); border-style: none none none solid; border-radius: 0.4rem; border-width: calc(3em / var(--font-size-no-units, 14)); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem;\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-a\" style=\"font-size: 1.3em;\"\u003eあなたはいやな\u003cruby\u003e経\u003crt\u003eけい\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003e\u003cruby\u003e験\u003crt\u003eけん\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eを\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"example-keyword\" style=\"color: color-mix(in srgb, lime, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)));\"\u003e\u003cruby\u003e避\u003crt\u003eさ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eける\u003c/span\u003eかもしれない。\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-b\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\"\u003eYou might avoid an unpleasant experience.\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"attribution-footnote\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: rgb(119, 119, 119); vertical-align: top; margin-left: 0.25rem;\"\u003e[2]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin-top: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"v1\" title=\"Ichidan verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003e1-dan\u003c/span\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;③\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto ward off\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto avert\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin-top: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"v1\" title=\"Ichidan verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003e1-dan\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"vt\" title=\"transitive verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003etransitive\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan title=\"valid only for these forms and/or readings\" style=\"cursor: help;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: crimson;\"\u003e〔\u003c/span\u003eよける only\u003cspan style=\"color: crimson;\"\u003e〕\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;④\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto put aside\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto move out of the way\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-sc-content=\"forms\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem;\"\u003e\u003cspan title=\"spelling and reading variants\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003eforms\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"margin-top: 0.2em;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"display:block;\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"table-layout:auto;border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:bold;border-style:solid;padding:0.25em;vertical-align:top;border-width:1px;border-color:currentColor;\"\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"font-weight:bold;border-style:solid;padding:0.25em;vertical-align:top;border-width:1px;border-color:currentColor;font-weight: normal; font-size: 1.2em; text-align: center;\"\u003e避ける\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"font-weight:bold;border-style:solid;padding:0.25em;vertical-align:top;border-width:1px;border-color:currentColor;font-weight: normal; font-size: 1.2em; text-align: center;\"\u003e除ける\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth style=\"font-weight:bold;border-style:solid;padding:0.25em;vertical-align:top;border-width:1px;border-color:currentColor;font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan title=\"reading applies only to these sense numbers\" style=\"cursor: help;\"\u003e②③\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"font-weight:bold;border-style:solid;padding:0.25em;vertical-align:top;border-width:1px;border-color:currentColor;font-weight: normal;\"\u00